oatkDB gene-family HMM databases
================================

viridiplantae_mito_v20250217.fam.gz and viridiplantae_pltd_v20260928.fam.gz
were built with the `oatkdb` script from OatkDB (https://github.com/c-zhou/OatkDB)
from NCBI GenBank Viridiplantae (taxid 33090) organelle genomes:

  oatkdb ... -o viridiplantae_mito_v20250217 33090 mitochondrion
  oatkdb -j 5 -t 10 -c 11 -o viridiplantae_pltd_v20260928 33090 chloroplast

poa decompresses and hmmpress-es them into its cache on first use
(poa.pipeline.common.oatkdb). OatkDB is distributed under the following licence:

